oduction project (MRP)\n\nIn a dual-screen setup, I cannot switch the editor to windowed mode.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112501/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}